You win every time.

1192
00:45:59,040 --> 00:45:59,440
No.

1193
00:45:59,440 --> 00:46:00,120
I was wondering that too.

1194
00:46:00,120 --> 00:46:01,320
How come I

1195
00:46:01,800 --> 00:46:02,480
