I wrote,

1203
00:46:14,560 --> 00:46:16,240
"I miss you so much
at the Purple House."

1204
00:46:17,080 --> 00:46:18,280
Let's pick that one.

1205
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:18,600
This one?

1206
00:46:18,600 --> 00:46:19,400
Yeah.

1207
00:46:19,400 --> 00:46:20,240
Look.

1208
00:46:20,240 --> 00:46:21,600
I even drew a little sign.

1209
00:46:25,720 --> 00:46:26,440
So cute.

1210
00:46:26,440 --> 00:46:27,880
"I miss you so much
at the Purple House."

1211
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:31,240
Get well soon.

1212
00:46:32,000 --> 00:46:32,400
Yeah.

1213
00:46:32,400 --> 00:46:33,480
Get well soon.

1214
00:46:33,480 --> 00:46:34,640
Just write from the heart.

1215
00:46:34,840 --> 00:46:36,240
That's all that matters.

1216
00:46:37,040 --> 00:46:38,680
Use my colored pens.

1217
00:46:43,700 --> 00:46:44,900
(Get well soon.
Can't wait to have you back.)

1218
00:46:44,920 --> 00:46:45,920
That's sweet.

1219
00:46:51,260 --> 00:46:53,300
(Xing, it's Hewen. We're all waiting
for you to come back.)

1220
00:47:03,480 --> 00:47:05,120
The whole house feels so warm

1221
00:47:05,120 --> 00:47:05,680
right now.

1222
00:47:05,680 --> 00:47:07,240
Everyone's writing to Xing.

1223
00:47:07,240 --> 00:47:07,740
Everyone's

1224
00:47:07,740 --> 00:47:08,860
(Sending their heartfelt wishes)
wishing her well,

1225
00:47:08,860 --> 00:47:09,320
right?

1226
00:47:11,760 --> 00:47:12,480
Sun Bohan,

1227
00:47:12,920 --> 00:47:15,240
I brought you three sticky notes.

1228
00:47:16,080 --> 00:47:18,040
Xing's sick, right?

1229
00:47:18,160 --> 00:47:20,840
So we're each writing her something

1230
00:47:20,840 --> 00:47:21,880
