1231
00:47:22,240 --> 00:47:22,720
Alright?

1232
00:47:23,160 --> 00:47:24,360
I already wrote mine.

1233
00:47:24,360 --> 00:47:25,080
You already did?

1234
00:47:25,360 --> 00:47:26,360
He already did.

1235
00:47:26,500 --> 00:47:32,620
(Two hours earlier)

1236
00:47:33,280 --> 00:47:34,520
He wrote it ages ago. He really cares.

1237
00:47:34,520 --> 00:47:35,960
He finished it two hours ago.

1238
00:47:38,120 --> 00:47:39,040
Xing,

1239
