1247
00:47:58,160 --> 00:48:00,680
I was only worried about you.

1248
00:48:02,360 --> 00:48:05,040
Waiting outside the hospital last night,

1249
00:48:05,520 --> 00:48:07,200
every single minute

1250
00:48:07,200 --> 00:48:08,280
