1251
00:48:08,530 --> 00:48:09,160
Oh my God.

1252
00:48:10,080 --> 00:48:12,200
It wasn't until I heard
your surgery went well

1253
00:48:12,720 --> 00:48:13,440
that I finally

1254
00:48:13,440 --> 00:48:15,280
felt a little relieved.

1255
00:48:17,760 --> 00:48:19,520
From the first day we met,

1256
00:48:20,160 --> 00:48:22,240
