not to draw closer to.

1262
00:48:36,360 --> 00:48:37,720
Are you happy?

1263
00:48:39,240 --> 00:48:40,640
It feels like happiness came knocking.

1264
00:48:43,880 --> 00:48:44,560
There's something about you

1265
00:48:44,560 --> 00:48:46,240
