1272
00:49:05,680 --> 00:49:08,040
Rest well and focus on getting better.

1273
00:49:08,040 --> 00:49:09,480
Hope you recover soon.

1274
00:49:09,480 --> 00:49:10,840
May every day be filled

1275
00:49:10,840 --> 00:49:12,960
