1280
00:49:38,120 --> 00:49:38,680
Sure.

1281
00:49:38,680 --> 00:49:39,800
Please give this to Xing.

1282
00:49:39,800 --> 00:49:40,200
Okay.

1283
00:49:41,200 --> 00:49:42,560
Sure. I'll give it to her tomorrow.

1284
00:49:42,560 --> 00:49:43,520
Okay.

1285
00:49:44,760 --> 00:49:45,880
Bye. Get some rest.

1286
00:49:45,880 --> 00:49:46,600
Okay.

1287
00:49:49,320 --> 00:49:50,960
Can I send flowers too?

1288
00:49:50,960 --> 00:49:51,720
No need.

1289
00:49:51,720 --> 00:49:53,440
Everyone's sending cards. That's plenty.

1290
00:49:53,440 --> 00:49:55,120
The cards are more than enough.

1291
00:49:55,160 --> 00:49:56,440
Feeling any better?

1292
00:49:56,840 --> 00:49:57,600
When Xing first

1293
00:49:57,600 --> 00:49:58,640
got here,

1294
00:49:59,600 --> 00:50:01,680
I couldn't wait to get back every day.

1295
00:50:01,680 --> 00:50:03,000
You were so happy then.

1296
00:50:03,160 --> 00:50:03,680
Yeah.

1297
00:50:04,520 --> 00:50:06,000
But these past couple days...

1298
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:07,680
With Xing gone from the house,

1299
00:50:07,680 --> 00:50:08,560
I feel like

1300
00:50:09,000 --> 00:50:10,040
I'm not

1301
