in a rush to come back anymore.

1302
00:50:11,690 --> 00:50:13,640
If she doesn't come back soon,

1303
00:50:13,640 --> 00:50:14,560
I really might...

1304
00:50:14,560 --> 00:50:15,960
I know what you mean.

1305
00:50:18,320 --> 00:50:18,960
It's okay.

1306
00:50:18,960 --> 00:50:20,560
Xing will be back soon.

1307
00:50:21,560 --> 00:50:22,840
Until then,

1308
00:50:23,160 --> 00:50:24,320
