1312
00:50:28,000 --> 00:50:28,840
Your "main quest".

1313
00:50:29,080 --> 00:50:30,680
You can't rush this kind of thing.

1314
00:50:30,680 --> 00:50:32,160
You can't force it either.

1315
00:50:32,160 --> 00:50:33,320
Just

1316
00:50:33,320 --> 00:50:34,800
let it happen naturally,

1317
00:50:34,800 --> 00:50:35,280
