1321
00:50:49,720 --> 00:50:50,920
Pretty adventurous.

1322
00:50:51,600 --> 00:50:52,840
I was sweating like crazy.

1323
00:50:53,520 --> 00:50:54,280
It was terrifying.

1324
00:50:54,990 --> 00:50:56,320
I had to be brave.

1325
00:50:57,760 --> 00:50:58,920
He was scared himself,

1326
00:50:58,920 --> 00:50:59,920
but to be there

1327
00:50:59,920 --> 00:51:01,680
