1329
00:51:04,410 --> 00:51:05,580
It felt really nice.

1330
00:51:05,620 --> 00:51:08,780
(It felt really nice)

1331
00:51:12,600 --> 00:51:14,360
Zhao Xilun suddenly seems so cute.

1332
00:51:15,560 --> 00:51:17,000
You're done for.

1333
00:51:17,000 --> 00:51:17,840
I'm done for.

1334
00:51:17,860 --> 00:51:18,360
Done for.

1335
00:51:18,360 --> 00:51:19,760
(Perfume from Zhao Xilun)

1336
00:51:19,760 --> 00:51:21,590
(A LunYue Full Moon)
There's no room for all these flowers.

1337
00:51:25,720 --> 00:51:26,880
Flower room.

1338
00:51:27,760 --> 00:51:29,240
It really is a flower room.

1339
00:51:33,860 --> 00:51:36,940
(Humming)

1340
00:51:40,880 --> 00:51:42,480
He looks really troubled.

1341
00:51:43,260 --> 00:51:47,500
(Sighs repeatedly)

1342
00:51:59,280 --> 00:51:59,680
We

1343
00:51:59,680 --> 00:52:00,440
haven't really seen

1344
00:52:00,440 --> 00:52:01,160
Chen Hewen like this

1345
00:52:01,160 --> 00:52:01,920
