1346
00:52:01,920 --> 00:52:03,320
He just keeps sighing.

1347
00:52:03,320 --> 00:52:04,160
He's really down.

1348
00:52:04,160 --> 00:52:05,720
He must be thinking about what to do.

1349
00:52:05,720 --> 00:52:07,520
Yeah. From what he's said,

1350
00:52:07,520 --> 00:52:08,340
I think deep down,

1351
00:52:08,340 --> 00:52:09,540
