1352
00:52:09,540 --> 00:52:11,000
He really cares about Sha Yue'er too.

1353
00:52:11,000 --> 00:52:12,560
It's just that his words

1354
00:52:12,560 --> 00:52:13,960
and actions

1355
00:52:13,960 --> 00:52:15,440
don't really show it.

1356
00:52:15,440 --> 00:52:16,520
So it's frustrating to watch.

1357
00:52:16,720 --> 00:52:17,360
Yeah.

1358
00:52:17,360 --> 00:52:18,040
But I think

1359
00:52:18,600 --> 00:52:20,920
Chen Hewen needs to pull himself
together fast.

1360
00:52:20,920 --> 00:52:22,640
Because if Zhao Xilun keeps this up...

1361
00:52:22,640 --> 00:52:23,920
Zhao Xilun is...

1362
00:52:23,920 --> 00:52:24,720
Dangerous.

1363
00:52:24,720 --> 00:52:25,560
He's coming on strong.

1364
00:52:25,560 --> 00:52:27,440
(Zhao Xilun charges ahead for love)
He's serious competition.

1365
00:52:27,440 --> 00:52:29,160
Chen Hewen still really cares

1366
00:52:29,160 --> 00:52:29,840
about Sha Yue'er.

1367
00:52:29,840 --> 00:52:31,080
I'm just scared he'll
miss his chance again.

1368
00:52:31,080 --> 00:52:31,680
You know?

1369
00:52:31,680 --> 00:52:32,840
(Guest Cupid, Jiang Shuying)
Whatever it takes,

1370
00:52:32,840 --> 00:52:34,440
I think he really needs

1371
00:52:35,200 --> 00:52:36,720
