1376
00:52:44,320 --> 00:52:45,800
(Sha Yue'er's gaze changed)
is definitely different now.

1377
00:52:46,400 --> 00:52:47,280
That's something

1378
00:52:47,280 --> 00:52:48,400
I think all of us girls

1379
00:52:48,400 --> 00:52:49,840
know exactly what it means.

1380
00:52:49,840 --> 00:52:50,200
Look.

1381
00:52:50,200 --> 00:52:51,640
Cui Kaiyi knows best what's

1382
00:52:51,640 --> 00:52:52,360
going on with Sha Yue'er.

1383
00:52:53,040 --> 00:52:53,880
"You're done for"

1384
00:52:53,880 --> 00:52:54,560
basically means

1385
00:52:54,560 --> 00:52:55,880
(She's fallen hard)
you've fallen for him.

1386
00:52:55,880 --> 00:52:57,840
You can't help yourself anymore.

1387
00:52:57,840 --> 00:52:59,200
And she said she suddenly realized

1388
00:52:59,200 --> 00:53:01,240
