1391
00:53:03,680 --> 00:53:05,240
I think her feelings are shifting.

1392
00:53:05,560 --> 00:53:06,440
(Agrees)
Yeah.

1393
00:53:06,440 --> 00:53:08,480
She's turned back toward the middle.

1394
00:53:08,480 --> 00:53:09,520
She's not leaning this way anymore.

1395
00:53:09,520 --> 00:53:10,960
She's realizing this guy over here

1396
00:53:10,960 --> 00:53:12,800
is actually pretty attractive.

1397
00:53:12,800 --> 00:53:15,000
(Zhao Xilun suddenly shows his charm)
She might slowly start looking his way.

1398
00:53:17,720 --> 00:53:18,240
Sha Yue'er,

1399
00:53:18,240 --> 00:53:19,200
I'm curious.

1400
00:53:19,200 --> 00:53:21,720
What flavor makes your heart
skip a beat?

1401
00:53:22,480 --> 00:53:23,480
Sweet and tangy.

1402
00:53:23,480 --> 00:53:25,480
Like Xizhilang Plum Jelly.

1403
00:53:25,480 --> 00:53:27,640
I happen to have some right here.

1404
00:53:27,840 --> 00:53:29,000
Peach flavor.

1405
00:53:29,000 --> 00:53:30,560
How'd you know I love these?

1406
00:53:32,520 --> 00:53:34,360
So chewy. It's so good.

1407
00:53:34,360 --> 00:53:35,960
I've also got grape

1408
00:53:35,960 --> 00:53:37,280
