for everyone to try.

1410
00:53:38,520 --> 00:53:38,960
Okay.

1411
00:53:43,580 --> 00:53:44,940
(Sun Qimeng heads out)

1412
00:53:44,960 --> 00:53:46,420
They have to work every day

1413
00:53:46,420 --> 00:53:47,420
