1414
00:53:47,420 --> 00:53:48,240
So busy.

1415
00:53:50,580 --> 00:53:52,860
(Sun Bohan comes to the dining room)

1416
00:53:54,960 --> 00:53:56,000
Hey, Si,

1417
00:53:56,000 --> 00:53:56,520
Cui Yihang,

1418
