1439
00:54:28,960 --> 00:54:29,680
Okay.

1440
00:54:33,820 --> 00:54:34,700
(Rinsing)

1441
00:54:34,700 --> 00:54:35,560
So thoughtful.

1442
00:54:38,640 --> 00:54:39,880
Look how attentive he is.

1443
00:54:43,240 --> 00:54:44,600
